B.bjg=new A.C('Shows how each of your holdings performed against its closest competitors \u2014 companies in the same industry first (like Gambling for Evolution), not just the same broad sector.\n\nEvery line in the chart starts at 0%, so stocks in different currencies and price levels compare fairly. Tap a name in the legend to hide or show its line \u2014 your own holding always stays on.\n\nThe dashed "Peer avg" line is the average of the competitors \u2014 think of it as your holding\'s own mini sector index. US stocks also get the real S&P 500 sector index.\n\nThe table shows P/E, beta and dividend yield \u2014 from a nightly snapshot for large companies, fetched live for the rest. "\u2014" means no data exists for that symbol.\n\nUse the search field to add up to 3 comparisons of your own \u2014 an index, a fund, any stock. They are saved to your account.\n\nThis card is a read-only view. It never affects your portfolio figures.',null,B.db,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.anY=s([B.Au,B.O,B.bjg],t.p)
